\">1</td><td>Tier 3 \u2013 Partially oversold</td><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">D1 D2 D3 W2 W3 W4</td><td>48549.77</td><td>-11%</td><td>-11%</td><td style=\"background:rgb(200,43,43)\">28 <small>(1th)</small></td><td style=\"background:rgb(200,41,41)\">36 <small>(0th)</small></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><a href='#' class='tl' data-t='NDX'><b>NDX</b></a></td><td style=\"font-size:12px\">Nasdaq-100 index</td><td style=\"background:#fbe7c6\"><b>6</b></td><td>0</td><td style=\"background:rgb(201,46,46)\">2</td><td>Tier 3 \u2013 Partially oversold</td><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">D1 D2 D3 W2 W3 W4</td><td>25405.28</td><td>-19%</td><td>-19%</td><td style=\"background:rgb(200,41,41)\">28 <small>(0th)</small></td><td style=\"background:rgb(200,41,41)\">35 <small>(0th)</small></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><a href='#' class='tl' data-t='SPX'><b>SPX</b></a></td><td style=\"font-size:12px\">S&P 500 index</td><td style=\"background:#fbe7c6\"><b>6</b></td><td>0</td><td style=\"background:rgb(202,47,47)\">2</td><td>Tier 3 \u2013 Partially oversold</td><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">D1 D2 D3 W2 W3 W4</td><td>6996.54</td><td>-11%</td><td>-11%</td><td style=\"background:rgb(200,41,41)\">27 <small>(0th)</small></td><td style=\"background:rgb(201,43,43)\">36 <small>(1th)</small></td></tr></tbody></table><div id='fig-flags' class='fig'></div>", "method": "\n<h3>Checklist (identical for every stock)</h3><table class='tbl '><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Oversold test</th><th>Threshold</th><th>Frame</th><th>Recent window</th><th>Rationale</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">D1</td><td>Daily RSI-14 \u2264 30</td><td>\u2264 30.0</td><td>Daily</td><td>10 sessions</td><td>Classic short-term washout</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">D2</td><td>Daily Stochastic %K(14,3) \u2264 20</td><td>\u2264 20.0</td><td>Daily</td><td>10 sessions</td><td>Close pinned at bottom of 3-week range</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">D3</td><td>Daily close below lower Bollinger (%B \u2264 0)</td><td>\u2264 0.00</td><td>Daily</td><td>10 sessions</td><td>2\u03c3 statistical extreme</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">D4</td><td>1-yr drawdown \u2265 median at prior swing lows</td><td>stock-relative: median at own prior swing lows</td><td>Daily</td><td>10 sessions</td><td>Has it fallen as far as at previous bottoms?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">D5</td><td>Below 200-d SMA \u2265 median at prior swing lows</td><td>stock-relative: median at own prior swing lows</td><td>Daily</td><td>10 sessions</td><td>Trend stretch comparable to previous bottoms</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">W1</td><td>Weekly RSI-14 \u2264 35</td><td>\u2264 35.0</td><td>Weekly</td><td>2 weeks</td><td>Intermediate-term washout, rare for quality names</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">W2</td><td>Weekly Stochastic %K(14,3) \u2264 20</td><td>\u2264 20.0</td><td>Weekly</td><td>2 weeks</td><td>Pinned at bottom of 14-week range</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">W3</td><td>Weekly Bollinger %B \u2264 0.10</td><td>\u2264 0.10</td><td>Weekly</td><td>2 weeks</td><td>Hugging/below weekly lower band</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">W4</td><td>Weekly RSI-14 in bottom 5% of 4-yr history</td><td>\u2264 5</td><td>Weekly</td><td>2 weeks</td><td>Rare reading for this specific stock</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace\">W5</td><td>13-week rate of change \u2264 \u221220%</td><td>\u2264 -20.0%</td><td>Weekly</td><td>2 weeks</td><td>Momentum crash in one quarter</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3>Turn signals (bonus, counted separately)</h3>\n<ul><li><b>T1</b> Daily MACD histogram rising over 3 bars</li><li><b>T2</b> Weekly MACD histogram rising over 3 bars</li>\n<li><b>T3</b> Bullish RSI divergence: lower price low but higher RSI low over ~6 months</li><li><b>T4</b> Daily RSI dipped \u226430 in last 10 sessions and has hooked back above 30</li></ul>\n<h3>Tiers</h3><ul><li>\u22657 flags \u2192 <b>Tier 1</b> (\u22652 turn signals) or <b>Tier 2</b> (no confirmed turn)</li><li>4\u20136 \u2192 Tier 3 partially oversold</li><li>2\u20133 \u2192 Tier 4 mild pullback</li><li>\u22641 \u2192 Tier 5 not oversold</li></ul>\n<h3>Percentiles</h3><p>Percentile = share of the last 4 years in which the indicator reading was <i>more</i> oversold than today. 0 = most extreme reading in the window, 50 = median. \"Pctile recent\" applies the same to the lowest reading in the recent window.</p>\n<h3>Data hygiene</h3><ul>\n<li>Source: Yahoo Finance, split/dividend-adjusted daily OHLCV; weekly bars derived from daily (Friday close).</li>\n<li>6 years downloaded; the first 2 years serve only as warm-up so 200-day SMA, 252-day rolling high, Wilder RSI recursion and 40-week SMA are fully formed before the 4-year percentile window begins.</li>\n<li>Every indicator is computed from raw price/volume only. The single exception, by design, is W4 (percentile rank of weekly RSI).</li>\n<li>Swing lows = bar whose low is the lowest within \u00b130 trading days (daily) / \u00b18 weeks (weekly) and \u226515% below the trailing 1-yr high; last 2 years; the current 45 days are excluded.</li>\n<li>Episodes = clusters of bars (gap \u226415 d / \u226435 d) when the indicator was at/below the threshold; forward returns measured from the last bar of the episode.</li>\n<li>Today's daily and weekly bars are partial (intraday) until the close.</li></ul>\n<h3>Data audit per ticker</h3><table class='tbl small'><thead><tr><th>Ticker</th><th>Raw from</th><th>Raw bars</th><th>Pctile window from</th><th>Daily bars</th><th>Weekly bars</th><th>Missing indicator values in window</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href='#' class='tl' data-t='COMP'><b>COMP</b></a></td><td>2020-11-20</td><td>1507</td><td>2022-11-21</td><td>1004</td><td>209</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td><a href='#' class='tl' data-t='DJI'><b>DJI</b></a></td><td>2020-11-20</td><td>1507</td><td>2022-11-21</td><td>1004</td><td>209</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td><a href='#' class='tl' data-t='NDX'><b>NDX</b></a></td><td>2020-11-20</td><td>1507</td><td>2022-11-21</td><td>1004</td><td>209</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td><a href='#' class='tl' data-t='SPX'><b>SPX</b></a></td><td>2020-11-20</td><td>1507</td><td>2022-11-21</td><td>1004</td><td>209</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table>", "summary": {"n": 4, "n_up": 0, "n_os": 4, "deep": 1, "top": [], "top_os": ["COMP", "DJI", "NDX", "SPX"], "top_up": []}}}, "target_html": {"SPX": "<p>No IBES / Refinitiv report for this ticker in the <b>Market indices</b> portfolio.</p>", "NDX": "<p>No IBES / Refinitiv report for this ticker in the <b>Market indices</b> portfolio.</p>", "COMP": "<p>No IBES / Refinitiv report for this ticker in the <b>Market indices</b> portfolio.</p>", "DJI": "<p>No IBES / Refinitiv report for this ticker in the <b>Market indices</b> portfolio.</p>"}, "flags": {"SPX": 6, "NDX": 6, "COMP": 7, "DJI": 6}}